    "One schedule for every benefit: this is when the ⏰ badge appears, when the single reminder is sent, and what the Expiring Soon list shows. When several benefits expire around the same day, they arrive as one summary notification." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有優惠使用同一時間表：這決定了⏰標記何時出現、提醒何時發送，以及「即將到期」清單顯示的內容。當多個優惠在相近日子到期時，會合併為一則摘要通知。"
